  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf \"Vaylantz World - Konig Wissen\" is in
    a Field Zone or if you control a FIRE \"Vaylantz\" monster: You can Special Summon
    this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column. You can only use this
    effect of \"Vaylantz Mad Marquess\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nDuring
    your Main Phase: You can roll a six-sided die, excavate that many cards from
    the top of your Deck (or as many as you can), and if you do, you can add 1 excavated
    \"Vaylantz\" card to your hand, also shuffle the rest into the Deck. If this
    card in the Monster Zone moves to another Monster Zone: You can roll a six-sided
    die, and if you roll a 2, 3, 4, or 5, Special Summon 1 Monster Card from your
    Spell & Trap Zone to your Main Monster Zone in its same column. You can only
    use each effect of \"Vaylantz Mad Marquess\" once per turn."
